Syntax: bangle <item>

Bangle works a wearable down into jewelry of the same slot.  Anyone may wear
what comes out, whatever their class, and the stats it carried come through
untouched.

The trade is severe and deliberate.  Jewelry is priced on the clothing
scale, so a heavy piece rescales down to it, and then its armor and its
structure are both halved.  What you get back is twice the room for stats,
by the same convention every jeweller works to.

Bangle is the only road from a wearable to something a mage can distill, so
it stands at the front of the essence trade.

See also: DISTILL, INFUSE, STRIP
Related Topics: SHAMAN
